IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`

-- Employment Insurance Act (S.C. 1996, c. 23), Part VIII.5 (Temporary Measures to Facilitate Access to Benefits):
-- s 153.196, Cessation of Effect. Written by piece ei6 (Sonnet 5.5) on 2026-10-24.
-- Text: the unofficial plain-text rendering of the Justice Laws consolidation current to 2026-09-30; nothing here is
-- claimed to be verified against the official text.
--
-- This section is in its own module because the other modules of Part VIII.5 are decided by it: each of their rules takes
-- a BOOLEAN, "Part VIII.5 has not ceased to apply under section 153.196", and the caller gets that BOOLEAN from
-- `s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` below, with the day the provision is being applied to (usually the day
-- the initial claim is made or the benefit period begins: fork F-ei6-9 in NOTES.md).
--
-- "Ceases to apply on D" is read as: the provision applies through D and not after (fork F-ei6-7). That reading fits
-- s 153.16, whose window ends on September 25, 2021, and Part VIII.6, whose first day is September 26, 2021.

§ `Section 153.196 - cessation of effect`

-- Subsection (1) is "subject to subsections (2) and (3)", which move the cessation of three provisions: so the
-- provisions of Part VIII.5 fall in three groups.
-- src:3080 | 153.196 (1) Subject to subsections (2) and (3), this Part ceases to apply on the earlier of September 25, 2021 and the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) is repealed.
-- src:3081 | Exception
-- src:3082 | (2) Section 153.19 ceases to apply on the earlier of October 31, 2020 and the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) is repealed.
-- src:3083 | Exception
-- src:3084 | (3) Sections 153.1922 to 153.1924 cease to apply on December 18, 2021.
@ref Employment Insurance Act s 153.196 (src:3080-3084)
DECLARE `ei6 Group of provisions of Part VIII.5 for cessation` IS ONE OF
    `ei6 section 153.19`
    `ei6 sections 153.1922 to 153.1924`
    `ei6 any other provision of Part VIII.5`

-- src:3080 | 153.196 (1) Subject to subsections (2) and (3), this Part ceases to apply on the earlier of September 25, 2021 and the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) is repealed.
@ref Employment Insurance Act s 153.196(1) (src:3080)
GIVETH A DATE
`s 153.196(1) the latest day on which Part VIII.5 ceases to apply` MEANS YearMonthDay 2021 9 25

-- src:3082 | (2) Section 153.19 ceases to apply on the earlier of October 31, 2020 and the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) is repealed.
@ref Employment Insurance Act s 153.196(2) (src:3082)
GIVETH A DATE
`s 153.196(2) the latest day on which section 153.19 ceases to apply` MEANS YearMonthDay 2020 10 31

-- src:3084 | (3) Sections 153.1922 to 153.1924 cease to apply on December 18, 2021.
@ref Employment Insurance Act s 153.196(3) (src:3084)
GIVETH A DATE
`s 153.196(3) the day on which sections 153.1922 to 153.1924 cease to apply` MEANS YearMonthDay 2021 12 18

-- Subsections (1) and (2): the earlier of the fixed day and the day Interim Order No. 8 is repealed (an input: the
-- text does not say when, or whether, it was repealed). Subsection (3): the fixed day, with no repeal condition.
-- src:3080 | 153.196 (1) Subject to subsections (2) and (3), this Part ceases to apply on the earlier of September 25, 2021 and the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) is repealed.
-- src:3081 | Exception
-- src:3082 | (2) Section 153.19 ceases to apply on the earlier of October 31, 2020 and the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) is repealed.
-- src:3083 | Exception
-- src:3084 | (3) Sections 153.1922 to 153.1924 cease to apply on December 18, 2021.
@ref Employment Insurance Act s 153.196 (src:3080-3084)
GIVEN group IS A `ei6 Group of provisions of Part VIII.5 for cessation`
      `the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) was repealed, if it has been` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `s 153.196 the day on which the provision ceases to apply` IS
    CONSIDER group
    WHEN `ei6 sections 153.1922 to 153.1924` THEN `s 153.196(3) the day on which sections 153.1922 to 153.1924 cease to apply`
    WHEN `ei6 section 153.19` THEN
        CONSIDER `the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) was repealed, if it has been`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN `s 153.196(2) the latest day on which section 153.19 ceases to apply`
        WHEN JUST repeal THEN
            IF repeal LESS THAN `s 153.196(2) the latest day on which section 153.19 ceases to apply`
            THEN repeal
            ELSE `s 153.196(2) the latest day on which section 153.19 ceases to apply`
    WHEN `ei6 any other provision of Part VIII.5` THEN
        CONSIDER `the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) was repealed, if it has been`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN `s 153.196(1) the latest day on which Part VIII.5 ceases to apply`
        WHEN JUST repeal THEN
            IF repeal LESS THAN `s 153.196(1) the latest day on which Part VIII.5 ceases to apply`
            THEN repeal
            ELSE `s 153.196(1) the latest day on which Part VIII.5 ceases to apply`

-- src:3080 | 153.196 (1) Subject to subsections (2) and (3), this Part ceases to apply on the earlier of September 25, 2021 and the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) is repealed.
-- src:3081 | Exception
-- src:3082 | (2) Section 153.19 ceases to apply on the earlier of October 31, 2020 and the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) is repealed.
-- src:3083 | Exception
-- src:3084 | (3) Sections 153.1922 to 153.1924 cease to apply on December 18, 2021.
@ref Employment Insurance Act s 153.196 (src:3080-3084)
GIVEN group IS A `ei6 Group of provisions of Part VIII.5 for cessation`
      day IS A DATE
      `the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) was repealed, if it has been` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` IF
    day AT MOST `s 153.196 the day on which the provision ceases to apply` group `the day on which Interim Order No. 8 Amending the Employment Insurance Act (Facilitated Access to Benefits) was repealed, if it has been`
